After the [[Battle of Endor]], a '''[[Painting|mural]]''' depicting the [[Spectres]], the [[white Loth-wolf]], and a [[Color|gray]] [[Loth-wolf]] was erected in [[Capital City]] on [[Lothal]]<ref name="Family&Farewell" /> by [[Mandalorian]] [[Sabine Wren]].<ref name="TSWB" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Ahsoka series date">{{AhsokaSeriesDate}}</ref> the mural was formally unveiled to the public on the [[Spectres mural ceremony|anniversary]] of the [[Liberation of Lothal]].<ref name="Part One">{{Ahsoka|Part One: Master and Apprentice}}</ref> Wren visited the mural and met with [[Ahsoka Tano]], who had arrived in [[T-6 1974|her]] [[T-6 shuttle]], to begin their [[Quest to find Ezra Bridger|search]] for [[Ezra Bridger]]<ref name="Part Two">{{Ahsoka|Part Two: Toil and Trouble}}</ref> while thinking about how the lives of her rebel family had changed over the years.<ref name="Family&Farewell" />

